WEBVTT

00:02.270 --> 00:03.830
Previously on "Final Space,"

00:03.860 --> 00:05.210
Gary journeys to Inner Space
to see the titan,

00:05.240 --> 00:07.140
Bolo, who's been asleep
for 10,000 years.

00:07.170 --> 00:09.490
While there, Gary's father
tells him to go to Earth

00:09.520 --> 00:11.250
to find the last
anti-matter bomb.

00:11.280 --> 00:13.530
With it, they can
close Final Space.

00:13.560 --> 00:15.320
Let's hope there's still time.

00:15.360 --> 00:17.080
Hey! Is that mustache Gary?

00:17.120 --> 00:18.570
It sure is.

00:21.220 --> 00:22.710
H.U.E.: Gary.

00:22.740 --> 00:25.400
The cookies will be done
in one minute.

00:25.430 --> 00:27.370
Gary: Oh, good.

00:27.400 --> 00:30.060
I'm extremely excited...

00:30.090 --> 00:33.370
for these cookies.

00:33.410 --> 00:34.550
I'm scared, H.U.E.

00:34.580 --> 00:36.070
I know, Gary.

00:36.100 --> 00:38.070
You'll stay with me
till the end?

00:38.100 --> 00:41.350
Till the very end.

00:41.380 --> 00:43.730
Thank you, H.U.E.

00:43.760 --> 00:46.940
It's been an honor
to be your friend.

00:51.390 --> 00:59.990
♪♪

01:00.020 --> 01:08.410
♪♪

01:08.440 --> 01:17.110
♪♪

01:19.140 --> 01:21.970
Little Caton:
Gary, what were your
father's exact instructions?

01:22.010 --> 01:25.110
He said, "Get the Anti-Matter
bomb and close the breach."

01:25.150 --> 01:27.810
Did he say where
on Earth the bomb is?

01:27.840 --> 01:30.500
In New York.
The one on Earth.

01:30.530 --> 01:31.850
That's a really big place.

01:31.880 --> 01:33.950
Gary, I might be able to help.

01:33.990 --> 01:36.230
I have found this
in your father's files.

01:36.260 --> 01:41.130
Log 2845B --
Captain John Goodspeed.

01:41.170 --> 01:44.690
Big day. Took forever,
but we finally got there.

01:47.480 --> 01:49.140
The Anti-Matter bomb.

01:49.170 --> 01:50.760
What we do here
could be the difference

01:50.800 --> 01:52.280
between Earth's survival

01:52.310 --> 01:54.590
and its being swallowed up
into Final Space.

01:54.630 --> 01:57.150
Hey, John,
if we survive this,

01:57.180 --> 02:01.120
what do you say we kick it up
with some taquitos, bro?

02:01.150 --> 02:03.530
I'm going to kill him.

02:03.570 --> 02:06.670
I know where that is.
It's the Infinity Guard Spire.

02:06.710 --> 02:09.680
Then next stop --
thatplace!

02:09.710 --> 02:11.990
♪♪

02:16.680 --> 02:18.720
[ Beeping ]

02:18.750 --> 02:21.170
Oh, my gosh!
H.U.E., wh-- what is going on?

02:21.210 --> 02:23.170
-Where are we?!
-Earth, Gary.

02:23.210 --> 02:24.830
It has shifted
from its coordinates

02:24.860 --> 02:26.730
and is being sucked
into the breach.

02:26.760 --> 02:28.730
The oceans are the first to go.

02:28.760 --> 02:31.180
Oh, my God.
It's happening.

02:31.220 --> 02:32.460
I blame KVN.

02:32.490 --> 02:33.870
Way to go, KVN. Way to go!

02:33.910 --> 02:35.290
I'm getting better!

02:35.320 --> 02:38.010
You're getting worse.
So much worse! It hurts!

02:38.050 --> 02:39.500
It hurts me physically!

02:39.530 --> 02:41.020
♪ Things are getting better

02:41.050 --> 02:44.330
♪ The sun is shining,
the clouds are parting ♪

02:44.370 --> 02:48.200
♪ And this guy is making
great striiides ♪

02:48.230 --> 02:50.200
Sing with me!
You're doing great, KVN.

02:50.230 --> 02:52.340
Thanks!
I am doing great!

02:52.370 --> 02:53.510
Oh, my God!

02:53.550 --> 02:56.240
That's different.

02:56.270 --> 02:57.480
Turtles?!

02:57.520 --> 02:58.860
That's a little one!

02:58.900 --> 03:00.210
Dear Heavenly Lightning Lord!

03:00.240 --> 03:03.110
We're being attacked
by Ninja Sea Turtles!

03:03.140 --> 03:06.110
No, Gary. But we have flown
into a school of them.

03:06.150 --> 03:08.770
[ Laughs ] Good!
They're still in school.

03:08.800 --> 03:10.700
[ Bang ]
Chookity.

03:10.740 --> 03:12.330
This is so wrong.

03:12.360 --> 03:13.950
This is very wrong.

03:17.470 --> 03:18.950
New York.

03:18.990 --> 03:21.580
The planet has been
mostly abandoned, Gary.

03:21.610 --> 03:25.370
Look at this place.
I've been to New York before.

03:25.410 --> 03:27.440
And this...

03:27.480 --> 03:31.140
This looks better. Not by much.

03:31.170 --> 03:32.720
Gary, uh-oh.

03:32.760 --> 03:36.940
You'll have six hours to locate the Anti-Matter bomb.

03:36.970 --> 03:42.040
After that, all of what
you see now will be gone.

03:42.080 --> 03:45.390
[ Whirring, pulsating ]

03:45.940 --> 03:48.460
The Infinity Guard
betrayed the human race.

03:48.500 --> 03:51.430
They chose their side,
and we're on the other.

03:51.470 --> 03:56.400
They will show us no mercy,
so I suggest we show them none.

03:56.440 --> 03:58.580
Now let's find that bomb.

03:58.610 --> 04:01.270
I have no idea what
you're talking about, but...

04:01.310 --> 04:03.380
Count. Me. Out!

04:03.410 --> 04:05.830
Later! [ Laughs ]

04:05.860 --> 04:07.310
Gary, the S.A.M.E.S.

04:07.350 --> 04:09.830
have retrofitted
the plasma torches, rail guns,

04:09.870 --> 04:11.730
and other sundry
maintenance equipment

04:11.760 --> 04:14.560
into heinous super weapons.

04:14.590 --> 04:17.110
Yes, H.U.E.!
Good lord, yes!

04:17.150 --> 04:18.560
Do you know what
that makes you?

04:18.600 --> 04:21.190
That makes you Employee
of the freaking Month.

04:21.460 --> 04:23.780
[ Buzzer ]

04:24.330 --> 04:26.990
Quinn, can I ask you
something?

04:27.020 --> 04:31.440
Soldier: Fire!Oh, my -- That came kinda fast!

04:31.470 --> 04:33.960
Take 'em out, boys!

04:33.990 --> 04:35.340
Mooncake: Cookity pok!

04:35.370 --> 04:37.620
[ Guns blasting ]

04:37.650 --> 04:39.790
Go, go, go, go!

04:39.830 --> 04:41.970
[ Laughs ] Oh!

04:42.000 --> 04:48.700
[ Guns blasting ]

04:48.730 --> 04:52.150
Quinn, I still have
that question.

04:52.180 --> 04:54.840
Yeah!
Boku!

04:58.090 --> 05:00.470
Mooncake: Woop! Pah!

05:00.500 --> 05:01.680
Gary: Go, Mooncake!

05:01.710 --> 05:05.020
Oh, oh, yes! Yes!
Oh, my -- oh, no.

05:06.920 --> 05:10.170
Quinn! About that question.

05:10.200 --> 05:11.650
What I wanted to ask
is would you like

05:11.690 --> 05:15.000
to drink alcoholic liquids
out of a cup with me?

05:15.030 --> 05:18.000
Now?
You're asking me this now?

05:18.040 --> 05:21.520
Oh, okay, just gonna
cartwheel away from me.

05:24.420 --> 05:27.180
Okay, that was close!
Oh, my God. Ow, ohh! Oh!

05:27.220 --> 05:30.190
But just, you know,
I mean, come on, Quinn.

05:30.220 --> 05:32.360
It jus-- it's just a drink.

05:32.400 --> 05:34.400
Shouldn't we be
concentrating on this?

05:34.430 --> 05:37.500
I can't concentrate on this
because all I am thinking about

05:37.540 --> 05:38.850
is if you wanna go out with me!

05:38.890 --> 05:39.850
Then no.

05:39.890 --> 05:42.370
[ Alarm blaring ]

05:42.410 --> 05:44.240
Die! Die!
Die! Why?

05:44.270 --> 05:46.820
Because I can't concentrate
on killing these guys

05:46.860 --> 05:50.070
if I'm concentrating
on that!

05:50.100 --> 05:51.380
Did anyone ever tell you

05:51.420 --> 05:53.870
emergency lighting
brings out your hotness?

05:53.900 --> 05:55.250
Shut up.

05:55.280 --> 05:56.520
[ Guns blasting ]

05:56.560 --> 05:59.530
♪♪

06:02.560 --> 06:09.290
♪♪

06:09.330 --> 06:11.540
[ Guns blasting ]

06:11.570 --> 06:13.020
Aah!

06:13.060 --> 06:15.720
Ohhh, don't worry, Gary.
KVN can handle this.

06:15.750 --> 06:17.270
KVN, don't handle this.

06:17.300 --> 06:18.790
Handle this?
You got it!

06:18.820 --> 06:21.380
[ Crash ]

06:23.930 --> 06:25.280
[ Rockets soaring ]

06:25.310 --> 06:26.550
[ Explosion ]

06:26.590 --> 06:28.970
[ Whirring, beeping ]

06:29.000 --> 06:30.450
KVN, what the freak is that?

06:30.490 --> 06:33.420
You just had a mech suit
lying around this whole time?!

06:33.460 --> 06:35.870
Yeah, so?

06:35.910 --> 06:39.430
[ Grunting ]

06:39.460 --> 06:42.910
Good lord, I hate you
so feverishly.

06:42.950 --> 06:45.120
It hurts. It physically
hurts me, KVN.

06:45.160 --> 06:46.570
Exo suit KVN: Hey, look, KVN!

06:46.610 --> 06:49.650
-Hey, guys!
-Hey, KVN.
-You look great.

06:49.680 --> 06:51.580
-Hey, KVN.
--What?
KVN, it's me -- KVN.

06:51.610 --> 06:53.130
-What?
-Who?
-Me?
-You!

06:53.170 --> 06:54.580
-Hey, KVN.
-Hey, look, it's KVN.

06:54.620 --> 06:56.170
-Hey, KVN, you look great!
-Hi, KVN! You look great!

06:56.200 --> 06:58.930
Hey, KVN, over here!
Where? Here! Haha!

06:58.970 --> 07:01.930
Don't shoot us --
shoot them.

07:01.970 --> 07:03.450
-Anything for a KVN!
-Anything for a KVN!

07:03.490 --> 07:06.460
-Anything for a KVN!
-Anything for a KVN!

07:06.490 --> 07:07.460
Handled!

07:07.490 --> 07:10.630
Gary,
give him a little something.

07:10.670 --> 07:12.320
How little?

07:12.360 --> 07:14.770
A thumbs up?

07:14.810 --> 07:17.090
Ugh. So much hurt.

07:17.120 --> 07:19.680
My thumb -- It's burning.
[ Cracks ]

07:19.710 --> 07:22.610
Oh! [ Screams ]

07:22.640 --> 07:24.090
We're best friends now.

07:24.130 --> 07:25.820
Guys, do you hear this?
We're best friends now.

07:25.850 --> 07:27.370
We're not even friends.

07:27.410 --> 07:29.720
Right. We're bestfriends.

07:32.650 --> 07:34.480
Gary, there isn't much time.

07:34.520 --> 07:37.310
Only four more hours
to locate the bomb

07:37.350 --> 07:39.800
before the Earth
is sucked into the breach.

07:39.830 --> 07:41.630
Bomb vault, yo!

07:41.660 --> 07:43.010
We found it, guys.

07:43.040 --> 07:44.320
[ Zaps ]

07:47.010 --> 07:49.390
[ Beeping, hissing ]

07:52.570 --> 07:55.850
It's gone. Where is it, H.U.E.?
We're running out of time.

07:55.880 --> 07:57.330
Odds are that space douche

07:57.370 --> 07:59.990
has instructed his
dickheads to hide it.

08:00.030 --> 08:01.610
H.U.E., can you find it?

08:01.650 --> 08:03.030
Mm-hmm.

08:03.060 --> 08:06.790
Hmmm. Ah. All files
have been deleted.

08:06.830 --> 08:10.660
Location unknown.Unknown?!

08:10.690 --> 08:13.630
Then it's over.

08:13.660 --> 08:15.210
Drop your weapons!

08:15.250 --> 08:16.660
Drop them now!

08:16.700 --> 08:18.910
Chookity!

08:18.940 --> 08:21.010
I mean...now it's over.

08:21.050 --> 08:22.810
I thought that --
I thought before we were over,

08:22.840 --> 08:25.530
but now we are
all going to die.

08:25.570 --> 08:26.920
Get down on the floor!

08:26.950 --> 08:30.060
Not that you asked,
but this is why you're single.

08:30.090 --> 08:33.720
I didn't ask. But since you
brought it up, enlighten me.

08:33.750 --> 08:36.930
Okay, well, I actually didn't
think that far ahead, but...

08:36.960 --> 08:39.440
Look, Gary, why do you
even like me?

08:39.480 --> 08:41.860
Because you're
everything I'm not.

08:41.900 --> 08:43.730
And that's
a good thing, right?

08:43.760 --> 08:45.170
Hell, yeah, it is.

08:45.210 --> 08:47.210
Guard: Commencing executions.

08:47.250 --> 08:50.250
Guard 2: Take the life form
to the Lord Commander.

08:50.280 --> 08:53.390
Just a second, guys.
Uh, look, love isn't a formula.

08:53.420 --> 08:55.910
It's messy.
It's real. It's raw.

08:55.940 --> 08:58.390
Prepare to die, traitor.

08:58.430 --> 08:59.530
Then, yes.

08:59.570 --> 09:02.360
I'll drink liquids
with you out of a cup.

09:02.400 --> 09:06.580
[ Laughs ]
I guess one drink can't hurt.

09:06.610 --> 09:07.890
Say goodbye.

09:07.920 --> 09:09.540
[ Zap, zap ]

09:11.750 --> 09:14.450
Sorry I'm late.
Tribore!

09:14.480 --> 09:15.690
Is it Tribore?

09:15.720 --> 09:17.620
It is!

09:17.660 --> 09:19.070
Pachu. Pachu.

09:19.110 --> 09:21.250
Pachu. Pachu. Pachu.

09:21.280 --> 09:23.280
Take five and call me
in the morning.

09:23.320 --> 09:25.460
Hey, guy! I don't know
who you are,

09:25.490 --> 09:28.220
but I like how you keep shooting
people even after they're dead.

09:28.250 --> 09:31.700
Isn't he great?
He's so handsome.

09:31.740 --> 09:33.600
Then welcome
to the Resistance.

09:33.640 --> 09:35.950
Pay attention.
He's talking.

09:37.640 --> 09:38.990
Quick, follow me.

09:39.020 --> 09:40.610
Will it be dangerous?

09:40.640 --> 09:43.750
You bet'cha!

09:43.790 --> 09:45.170
Chookity!

09:45.200 --> 09:46.750
What are you doing here?!

09:46.790 --> 09:49.510
When the Lord Commander
infiltrated the Infinity Guard,

09:49.550 --> 09:53.590
a Resistance rose up
and they needed a leader.

09:53.620 --> 09:56.450
Someone pure of spirit
and incorruptible.

09:56.490 --> 10:00.460
Only one person
met those criteria.

10:00.490 --> 10:02.600
Tribore.

10:02.630 --> 10:04.810
I thought you've just been
skulking around my apartment

10:04.840 --> 10:06.010
wearing my dresses.

10:06.050 --> 10:07.460
I was in deep cover.

10:07.500 --> 10:09.950
Do I have to explain
myself to you? I don't.

10:09.980 --> 10:12.370
Is that my scarf?It was.

10:12.400 --> 10:14.780
Does this Resistance
of yours happen to know

10:14.820 --> 10:16.780
where an Anti-Matter bomb is?

10:16.820 --> 10:18.370
Not yet.

10:18.410 --> 10:20.960
Richard? Hack into
the mainframe.

10:20.990 --> 10:23.310
We need to find
an Anti-Matter bomb.

10:23.340 --> 10:25.860
This way!Shannon: This is amazing.

10:26.480 --> 10:28.800
So this is the end
of the world.

10:28.830 --> 10:30.180
I was hoping for more.

10:30.210 --> 10:32.010
Richard said there
was a secret base

10:32.040 --> 10:34.110
where the bomb is being kept.

10:34.150 --> 10:35.840
That's so Richard.

10:35.870 --> 10:37.460
Do you want to get a drink?

10:37.490 --> 10:38.630
Oh, wait. You're busy.

10:38.670 --> 10:40.460
Why would you want
to get a drink with me?

10:40.500 --> 10:42.260
Just looking
at you is enough...

10:43.710 --> 10:45.190
...for a lifetime.

10:45.230 --> 10:47.990
This is the bar
where we first met!

10:48.020 --> 10:49.300
The entrance is hidden.

10:49.330 --> 10:51.580
How do I know?
I actually don't know.

10:51.610 --> 10:53.960
Come on, KVN.
I need your sensors.

10:53.990 --> 10:55.960
I have sensors?!
Hooray for KVN!

10:56.000 --> 10:58.720
Gary, I have sensors! Yay!

10:58.760 --> 11:00.520
Oh, I can't believe it.
Look -- I can't believe it...

11:00.550 --> 11:03.970
So, are you going to buy me
that drink or what?

11:04.000 --> 11:06.560
Hell, yeah, I am.
Pick your poison.

11:07.010 --> 11:08.420
[ Glasses clink ]

11:09.590 --> 11:11.040
[ Seat squeaks ]

11:13.770 --> 11:19.400
So, I guess, I'm just saying,
this is our first date.

11:19.430 --> 11:20.500
I'm gonna die!

11:20.540 --> 11:23.540
We're entering
the meaningless void!

11:23.570 --> 11:25.230
Cheers.

11:25.270 --> 11:28.060
Civilization ends now!

11:28.100 --> 11:31.100
Glass clink.

11:31.130 --> 11:33.550
Did Tribore find it?
He did!

11:33.580 --> 11:37.660
No thanks to Richard,
which, again, is so Richard.

11:38.900 --> 11:40.660
[ Buzzing ]

11:44.910 --> 11:47.010
[ Door creaks ]
Aah!

11:47.050 --> 11:50.740
No freaking way.

11:50.770 --> 11:54.740
Five years ago I karate chopped
this man to steal his clothes.

11:54.780 --> 11:56.430
Schwa!

11:59.610 --> 12:01.230
Swallow!

12:01.270 --> 12:03.890
You're a good guy, Gary!

12:03.930 --> 12:06.240
Did not anyone help him?!

12:06.270 --> 12:08.550
Oh, you jerk face.

12:08.580 --> 12:09.900
He's still alive.

12:09.930 --> 12:12.040
I gave him aspirin --

12:12.070 --> 12:14.760
No, I gave him Crylenol.

12:14.800 --> 12:16.800
Oh, and I overdosed him.

12:16.830 --> 12:19.110
You're not a good guy, Gary.

12:19.150 --> 12:21.810
Oh, you're such
a terrible human being!

12:21.840 --> 12:25.670
KVN, are you detecting
anything worth chatting about?

12:25.710 --> 12:27.120
Nope. Nope.

12:27.160 --> 12:31.120
Ooh, I mean yes!

12:31.160 --> 12:34.330
Announcer:
Secret underground bathroom
base now accessible.

12:34.370 --> 12:35.610
Tight!

12:37.920 --> 12:39.650
Gary, there is a reinforced
concrete structure

12:39.680 --> 12:42.520
17 meters below the surface.

12:42.550 --> 12:44.000
Not to be a buzzkill,

12:44.030 --> 12:45.690
but the breach's effect
on the Earth

12:45.730 --> 12:47.930
is reaching critical mass.

12:51.350 --> 12:53.490
Gary, would you stop
making the face

12:53.530 --> 12:54.940
and hurry up?

12:59.700 --> 13:07.020
♪♪

13:07.060 --> 13:14.200
♪♪

13:14.240 --> 13:21.380
♪♪

13:21.420 --> 13:28.010
♪♪

13:28.040 --> 13:29.630
♪♪

13:29.670 --> 13:34.020
Gary, I am detecting very high
levels of Anti-Matter.

13:34.050 --> 13:36.050
Tribore.
You did an okay job.

13:36.090 --> 13:38.850
It was nice work.
It was!

13:38.880 --> 13:42.960
Gary: The bomb's in there.
You guys, stay back.

13:42.990 --> 13:44.750
I'm goin' in to get it.

13:44.780 --> 13:47.300
Ah, uh, aah!

13:47.340 --> 13:49.170
Run!Careful, Gary!

13:51.790 --> 13:53.760
[ Click, hiss ]

13:55.420 --> 13:58.350
Structural collapse
imminent.

13:58.380 --> 13:59.590
Get out!

13:59.630 --> 14:01.150
If I get you home by nine,

14:01.180 --> 14:03.700
what are my chances of getting
some lip-to-lip action?

14:03.730 --> 14:06.910
I'm gonna go with moderate.Moderate?

14:06.940 --> 14:09.220
Oh good lord,
my slacks are tightening.

14:09.260 --> 14:11.190
Settle down, Cowboy.

14:11.220 --> 14:13.360
Wahwahwahwahwahwah.Aah.

14:18.300 --> 14:20.750
♪♪

14:22.650 --> 14:24.860
Gary --
What's up?

14:26.790 --> 14:28.900
This is actually
a pretty good first date.

14:28.930 --> 14:34.420
[ Rumbling ]

14:34.450 --> 14:36.080
Ugh!

14:36.110 --> 14:38.180
Quinn!

14:38.220 --> 14:40.600
Quinn!!

14:40.630 --> 14:41.810
Little Cato!

14:41.840 --> 14:43.260
Get this back
to the ship, Spider Cat.

14:43.290 --> 14:45.190
you got it,
Thunder Bandit.

14:45.220 --> 14:48.300
Gary, you do not have the
required speed to reach Quinn

14:48.330 --> 14:49.920
before the pressure kills her.

14:49.950 --> 14:51.130
Who said it was
just going to be me?

14:51.160 --> 14:52.920
Mooncake, double time it!Chokity!

14:52.960 --> 14:57.310
Chok chok chok chok
chok chok chok chok!

14:57.340 --> 14:58.550
H.U.E.! Distance.

14:58.580 --> 15:00.030
130 feet.

15:00.070 --> 15:02.930
Approaching crush depth.

15:02.970 --> 15:04.310
I can see her light.

15:04.350 --> 15:06.380
I would advise you
to go no further.

15:06.420 --> 15:08.940
Seeing as I know
you won't listen to me...

15:08.970 --> 15:12.730
hurry.

15:12.770 --> 15:14.490
H.U.E., what is this?

15:14.530 --> 15:16.320
I am detecting
high levels of magma

15:16.360 --> 15:18.570
about to break through
the Earth's crust.

15:18.600 --> 15:22.090
Oh, no...

15:22.120 --> 15:23.850
Mooncake! Triple time!

15:23.880 --> 15:25.330
Oh, no!

15:27.540 --> 15:29.340
Aah! Aah!

15:33.720 --> 15:35.690
Activate gravity boots!

15:35.720 --> 15:43.320
♪♪

15:43.350 --> 15:50.770
♪♪

15:50.810 --> 15:58.370
♪♪

15:58.400 --> 16:05.860
♪♪

16:05.890 --> 16:07.200
H.U.E.!
Where are you going?

16:07.240 --> 16:10.210
Don't worry,
we will not leave Gary.

16:10.240 --> 16:20.040
♪♪

16:20.080 --> 16:22.050
Go, go, go, go, go, go,
go, Mooncake! Go!!

16:22.080 --> 16:23.870
Ohhh, go, go, go, go, go!

16:23.910 --> 16:26.220
Wa-ehhhhh --

16:26.260 --> 16:27.530
Chokity!!

16:27.570 --> 16:31.020
♪♪

16:31.050 --> 16:33.130
[ Laughs ]

16:33.160 --> 16:34.540
It's not that impressive.

16:34.570 --> 16:35.820
♪♪

16:35.850 --> 16:42.070
Mooncake,
there you are.

16:43.620 --> 16:46.930
♪♪

16:46.970 --> 16:53.840
♪ If only I could fix
the sky... ♪

16:53.870 --> 16:56.670
No, no, no, no, no. No.

16:56.700 --> 16:57.600
H.U.E.!

16:57.630 --> 17:03.050
♪♪

17:03.090 --> 17:09.680
♪ It's got a way of knowing
when to hurt me ♪

17:09.710 --> 17:14.930
♪ Oh, it's when
the night is long ♪

17:14.960 --> 17:17.340
♪♪

17:17.380 --> 17:20.550
Where am I? I remember...
I was in the bathroom.

17:20.590 --> 17:24.450
I had zippered
my pants, and then...

17:24.490 --> 17:27.900
Oh, my God! Aah!

17:27.940 --> 17:30.490
Oh God! Okay...

17:31.980 --> 17:34.530
You jerk!
You jerk face!

17:34.570 --> 17:39.950
♪ Earthquakes break and
shatter the perfect design ♪

17:41.990 --> 17:44.130
Gary?
You're back.

17:44.160 --> 17:45.370
Thought I lost you.

17:45.400 --> 17:46.960
Where are we?
Currently...

17:46.990 --> 17:50.310
well, uh, we're being
yanked into space.

17:50.340 --> 17:54.450
♪ Towers rise to meet
and hear its laughter ♪

17:54.480 --> 17:57.240
Maybe it's because my head
is in the clouds --

17:57.280 --> 17:59.110
Not gonna laugh
at that one, okay. Ha.

17:59.140 --> 18:00.660
I was hoping
for a laugh there --

18:00.700 --> 18:03.490
Would you perchance want
to join forces with me

18:03.530 --> 18:05.110
on a daily basis?

18:05.150 --> 18:07.630
I'm gonna give that
a hard maybe.

18:07.670 --> 18:10.640
I'll take it!
Are you hearing this, Earth?

18:10.670 --> 18:13.710
We're hard maybes! Yes!!

18:18.710 --> 18:24.060
♪ Ohh, oh, oohhh

18:26.270 --> 18:29.860
♪ Ohh, oh, oohhh

18:29.900 --> 18:33.210
[ Screaming ]

18:34.320 --> 18:39.560
♪ Ohh, oh, oohhh

18:42.190 --> 18:47.360
♪ Ohh, oh, oohhh

18:50.750 --> 18:53.540
♪ Ohh, oh, oohhh

18:53.580 --> 18:56.130
H.U.E.! Set a course
for the breach.

18:58.100 --> 19:03.720
♪ Ohh, oh, oohhh

19:06.000 --> 19:11.080
♪ Ohh, oh, oohhh

19:11.110 --> 19:15.180
This could have been so easy.

19:15.220 --> 19:21.570
But time and time again,
you chose the harder path.

19:21.600 --> 19:23.670
The darker path.

19:23.710 --> 19:29.580
It's time for you to see that
your choices have consequences.

19:29.610 --> 19:37.690
I will give you one last chance
to hand over Mooncake.

19:41.970 --> 19:43.690
Chookity.

19:43.730 --> 19:45.110
Hell. No.

19:45.140 --> 19:46.870
He is one of us.

19:46.900 --> 19:48.250
I don't really know him.

19:48.290 --> 19:51.080
But he seems very popular.

19:52.770 --> 19:54.710
He stays with us.

19:54.740 --> 19:56.020
Never.

19:56.050 --> 19:58.090
Then death it is!

19:58.120 --> 19:59.950
I'm coming for you.

19:59.990 --> 20:04.680
Ah, yes, I've seen
that face before.

20:04.720 --> 20:06.440
The face of loss.

20:06.480 --> 20:08.510
We have the
Anti-Matter bomb!

20:08.550 --> 20:11.620
We will close the breach --
you will die!

20:11.650 --> 20:15.140
[ Laughs ]

20:15.170 --> 20:17.730
I look forward to it.

20:19.560 --> 20:21.970
I'm detecting
the approach of an armada

20:22.010 --> 20:24.800
of heavy incinerators.

20:24.840 --> 20:26.120
Everyone's gonna die.

20:26.150 --> 20:27.460
You aren't wrong.

20:27.500 --> 20:30.150
They'reall going to die.

20:30.190 --> 20:33.570
If he wants a war,
he's got one.

20:33.610 --> 20:35.160
Let's do this.

20:39.850 --> 20:44.000
♪♪

20:44.030 --> 20:46.270
♪♪
